const icons={crop:'<path d="M5 2v17h17M2 5h17v17M8 8h8v8H8z"/>',palette:'<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="7" r="1"/><circle cx="7" cy="14" r="1"/><path d="M20 14h-5v5"/>',grid:'<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3v18"/>',board:'<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3"/><path d="M14 3v18M3 15h11M14 10h7"/>',download:'<path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 17v4h16v-4"/>',text:'<path d="M5 4h14M12 4v16M8 20h8"/>'};
